license: CC-BY-4.0

abstract: >
  This replication package accompanies the empirical study
  "An Empirical Study of Hallucination-Induced Failures in
  LLM-Based Agent-Authored Pull Requests". It contains the
  manually annotated datasets, annotation guidelines, and
  supporting materials used to investigate hallucination
  behaviors, their evolution, workflow outcomes, and early
  hallucination indicators in agent-authored pull requests.

